00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:19.552 line:78%
JOHN GIBSON WAS THE CEO OF

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:20.520 line:78%
TRIPWIRE, A VIDEO GAME COMPANY.

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:22.222 line:78%
