00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:25.692 line:78%
QUOTE, PROUD OF THE U.S. SUPREME

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:26.559 line:78%
COURT AFFIRMING THAT TEXAS LAW

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:27.560 line:78%
BANNING ABORTION FOR BABIES WITH

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:30.030 line:78%
