AS AN ENTERTAINER I DON'T GET

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:33.833 line:78%
POLITICAL OFTEN, YET WITH SO

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:36.169 line:78%
MANY VOCAL PEERS ON THE OTHER

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:38.338 line:78%
SIDE OF THE ISSUE I FELT IT WAS

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:40.540 line:78%
IMPORTANT TO GO ON THE RECORD

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:41.541 line:78%
ACE PRO-LIFE GAME DEVELOPER."

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.642 line:78%
THAT WAS IT.

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:43.843 line:78%
HE DIDN'T ATTACK ANYONE, JUST

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:46.746 line:78%
SAID WHAT HE BELIEVED.

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:47.347 line:78%
