00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:51.851 line:78%
THE COMPANY THAT HE STARTED, WAS

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:53.453 line:78%
MAJORITY OWNER OF, OR HAD THE

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:55.155 line:78%
LARGEST OWNERSHIP STAKE IN, AND

00:00:53.553 --> 00:01:01.261 line:78%
THEN THE MEDIA DECIDED TO

00:00:55.255 --> 00:01:01.895 line:78%
DESTROY HIM PERSONALLY.

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:05.331 line:78%
UNBELIEVABLE EXPERIENCE.

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:07.801 line:78%
WE SPOKE TO HIM ABOUT IT.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:09.235 line:78%
HERE'S PART OF THE CONVERSATION.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:10.503 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I CALL IT SOCIAL TERRORISM.

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:14.374 line:78%
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:19.946 line:78%
&gt;&gt; IT IS AN EFFORT TO USE FEAR

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:22.482 line:78%
AND INTIMIDATION TO CAUSE PEOPLE

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:24.517 line:78%
TO CHANGE -- EITHER -- EITHER

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:26.619 line:78%
HIDE OR PRETEND THAT THEY'RE NOT

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:29.856 line:78%
TO WHAT THEY ARE REALLY SO THEY

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:32.392 line:78%
CAN KEEP THEIR JOBS, THEY CAN

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:34.060 line:78%
KEEP THEIR STATUS, AND I JUST

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:36.262 line:78%
THINK THAT'S -- THAT'S JUST A

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:37.430 line:78%
TERRIBLE THING FOR THE WORLD.

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:39.132 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WELL, IT'S PRIMA

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:42.068 line:78%
FACIA EVIL FOR ONE THING.

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:44.104 line:78%
TERRORISM IS ALWAYS WRONG.

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.471 line:78%
YOU KNOW, EVERYTHING SHOULD BE

00:01:44.204 --> 00:01:46.706 line:78%
VOLUNTARY.

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:47.774 line:78%
I MEAN, YOU CAN'T FORCE PEOPLE

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:48.475 line:78%
TO BELIEVE SOMETHING.

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:53.113 line:78%
THAT'S CRAZY.

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:54.981 line:78%
YOU KNOW, THAT'S EIGHTH CENTURY

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:55.348 line:78%
ISLAM, BEING BEHEADED OR

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:56.449 line:78%
SOMETHING.

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:58.685 line:78%
THERE WAS NOT ONE PERSON -- BY

00:01:56.549 --> 00:02:00.120 line:78%
THE WAY, I WROTE DOWN SOCIAL

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:00.420 line:78%
TERRORISM, BECAUSE I'M STEALING

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:03.189 line:78%
THAT.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:03.656 line:78%
I'M NOT GIVING YOU CREDIT.

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:06.192 line:78%
SORRY.

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:08.895 line:78%
IT'S SUCH A PRECISE PHRASE

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:10.463 line:78%
VERSUS COUNTER CULTURE, WHICH IS

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:11.865 line:78%
PATHETIC AND WEAK, AND DOES NOT

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:13.466 line:78%
DESCRIBE THE PHENOMENON.

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:15.034 line:78%
NOT ONE PERSON IN YOUR WORLD

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:17.237 line:78%
STOOD UP AND SAID WE CANNOT

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:18.304 line:78%
CRUSH THIS MAN BECAUSE HE HAS A

00:02:17.937 --> 00:02:20.773 line:78%
DIFFERENT VIEW?

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:25.845 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THERE WAS -- UMM, THERE WAS

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:27.413 line:78%
ONE PERSON, WITHIN THE COMPANY,

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:28.815 line:78%
THAT -- UMM, UMM, A LADY THAT

00:02:27.514 --> 00:02:30.550 line:78%
WAS RESISTANT TO WHAT THEY WERE

00:02:28.915 --> 00:02:31.251 line:78%
DOING TO ME.

