&gt;&gt; Tucker: GOOD FOR HER.

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:34.621 line:78%
&gt;&gt; UMM, AND SHE WAS FAIRLY

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.724 line:78%
SENIOR.

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:38.858 line:78%
UMM, AND I REALLY APPRECIATED

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:43.062 line:78%
HER, YOU KNOW, SORT OF STANDING

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:44.864 line:78%
UP AND PUSHING BACK.

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:45.899 line:78%
BUT IT WAS -- IT WAS -- IT WAS

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:48.368 line:78%
DIFFICULT FOR HER, TOO.

00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:50.336 line:78%
I MEAN, SHE WAS OUTNUMBERED.

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:53.907 line:78%
UMM, AND -- BUT ALSO IN THE

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:57.277 line:78%
POSITION SHE WAS IN, SHE WAS

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:59.412 line:78%
HAVING TO DEAL WITH A LOT OF THE

00:02:57.377 --> 00:03:01.014 line:78%
FALLOUT, AND THAT'S -- THAT'S

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:02.549 line:78%
HOW THIS SOCIAL TERRORISM WORKS,

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:04.050 line:78%
IS YOU MAKE PEOPLE SCARED.

