00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:10.323 line:78%
ARE GOING TO LEAVE THE COMPANY

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:12.759 line:78%
IF THEY DON'T, YOU KNOW, THROW

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:14.694 line:78%
THE PERSON WHO -- WHO DISAGREED

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:17.797 line:78%
WITH IN AS POLITICAL POSITIONS

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:20.934 line:78%
OUT OF THE BOAT.

00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:23.603 line:78%
AND, UMM, SO SHE REALLY COULDN'T

00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:24.971 line:78%
OVERCOME THE WAVE OF SENTIMENT

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:26.973 line:78%
OF THE OTHER FOLKS.

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:28.541 line:78%
THEN THE PEOPLE THAT -- THAT --

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:29.776 line:78%
THE OTHER PEOPLE THAT AGREED,

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:34.480 line:78%
THEY'RE AFRAID TO SPEAK UP.

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:37.116 line:78%
THEY DON'T WANT TO BE NEXT.

00:03:34.581 --> 00:03:40.486 line:78%
UMM, I HAD ONE OF THE OWNER OWE

00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:42.188 line:78%
OTHER OWNERS OF THE COMPANY

00:03:40.587 --> 00:03:44.057 line:78%
POLITICALLY WERE VERY, VERY,

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:45.758 line:78%
UMM, WERE VERY ALIGNED.

00:03:44.157 --> 00:03:48.628 line:78%
HE THINKS CANCEL CULTURE IS BAD.

00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:51.164 line:78%
HE THINKS ABORTION IS BAD.

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:54.167 line:78%
UMM, AND HE SAID, UMM, YEAH, I

00:03:51.297 --> 00:03:56.269 line:78%
DON'T WANT TO BE CANCELED NEXT.

