00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:03.343 line:78%
YEARS.

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:04.777 line:78%
TO SEE THEM PARTICIPATE IN THIS

00:04:03.443 --> 00:04:08.715 line:78%
MUST HAVE DESTROYED YOU.

00:04:06.446 --> 00:04:10.550 line:78%
&gt;&gt; TUCKER, WORDS -- WORDS CAN

00:04:08.815 --> 00:04:14.320 line:78%
HARDLY CONVEY, UMM, HOW CRUSHED

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:17.890 line:78%
I WAS.

