UMM, YOU -- EVERYONE THAT WORKS

00:04:17.991 --> 00:04:21.027 line:78%
PUTS A LITTLE BIT OF THEMSELVES

00:04:19.092 --> 00:04:21.561 line:78%
INTO SOMETHING, OR MAYBE A LOT.

00:04:21.194 --> 00:04:23.396 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YEAH.

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:24.731 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WHEN YOU'RE DOING -- WHEN

00:04:23.496 --> 00:04:26.165 line:78%
YOU'RE SOMETHING THAT -- LIKE

00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:29.068 line:78%
THIS, A PASSION, SOMETHING YOU

00:04:26.266 --> 00:04:30.970 line:78%
USED TO DO FOR FREE, AND YOU

00:04:29.168 --> 00:04:33.640 line:78%
JUST ABSOLUTELY LOVE IT, AND

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:35.308 line:78%
IT'S -- YOU SPENT 20 YEARS, 25

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:36.976 line:78%
YEARS OF YOUR LIFE, CRAFTING THE

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:39.045 line:78%
SKILL SET, AND YOU'RE AT THE TOP

00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:40.780 line:78%
OF YOUR GAME, AND YOU LOVE WHAT

00:04:39.145 --> 00:04:44.250 line:78%
YOU DO EVERY DAY, JUST LOVE

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:44.851 line:78%
COMING INTO WORK, AND MAKING

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:47.120 line:78%
PEOPLE HAPPY.

00:04:45.518 --> 00:04:48.554 line:78%
AND WE -- WE WERE MAKING, SURE,

