00:04:58.865 --> 00:05:01.501 line:78%
I WOULD SEE PEOPLE COMING INTO

00:05:00.266 --> 00:05:02.735 line:78%
WORK, SMILING AND HAPPY.

00:05:01.601 --> 00:05:04.304 line:78%
I JUST LOVED HAVING A JOB WHERE

