PUBLIC HAPPY, BUT THE EMPLOYEES

00:05:06.205 --> 00:05:10.476 line:78%
HAPPY.

00:05:06.539 --> 00:05:13.046 line:78%
AND TO HAVE THAT ALL DESTROYED,

00:05:10.576 --> 00:05:14.881 line:78%
UMM, TO FEEL LIKE -- WELL, I

