I SAID -- I SAID I JUST WANT TO

00:05:22.388 --> 00:05:25.725 line:78%
DIE, YOU KNOW, BECAUSE I DON'T

00:05:24.324 --> 00:05:29.462 line:78%
WANT TO LIVE -- I DON'T WANT TO

