&gt;&gt; Tucker: I AGREE.

00:05:32.365 --> 00:05:35.301 line:78%
&gt;&gt; AND YEAH.

00:05:33.599 --> 00:05:41.040 line:78%
YEAH, I GOT DEPRESSED.

00:05:35.868 --> 00:05:41.474 line:78%
I GOT, OF COURSE, ANGRY,

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:45.978 line:78%
SUICIDAL.

